<title>USA: Huntco Inc Q2 Oct 31 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Huntco Inc Q2 Oct 31 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>TOWN &amp; COUNTRY, Mo. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>(dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					    Six Months   Three Months</p>
<p>				   Ended October 31  Ended October 31</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales		    $162,413 $117,178  $83,983  $62,072</p>
<p>Income (loss) from operations</p>
<p>				    10,756  (4,798)    5,393  (6,577)</p>
<p>Other income (expense):</p>
<p>  Interest, net		(2,694)  (1,137)  (1,492)    (810)</p>
<p>  Other, net			   -	  2	  -	  2</p>
<p>Income (loss) before</p>
<p>  income taxes		   8,062  (5,933)    3,901  (7,385)</p>
<p>Provision (benefit) for</p>
<p>  income taxes		   3,075  (2,186)    1,484  (2,732)</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	     4,987  (3,747)    2,417  (4,653)</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per share     .56    (.42)	.27    (.52)</p>
<p>Weighted average common shares</p>
<p>   outstanding		   8,952    8,940    8,951    8,940</p>
<p>NOTE: Included in the net loss for the quarter ended October 31, 1995 was a charge for a lower of cost or market inventory adjustment of $5.0 million, net of income tax benefits, or $.56 per share.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
